Third-party skills

This license covers the skills authored by Bruno Andrade (those whose SKILL.md
declares `metadata.author: Bruno Andrade`), the Gauntlet skill and agents, the
installers, the tests and the documentation of this repository.

The following skills were written by other people and are redistributed here
